#: ../../funding/jingan-service-2026.rst:1
msgid ""
"Jing'an Service Industry Guidance Fund and AI Demonstration Support, 2026"
msgstr "2026静安服务业发展引导资金与人工智能示范支持"

#: ../../funding/jingan-service-2026.rst:4
msgid "Grant | Jing'an"
msgstr "补助｜静安区"

#: ../../funding/jingan-service-2026.rst:6
msgid "2026 call published; deadline check required"
msgstr "2026通知已公布，须核验截止日"

#: ../../funding/jingan-service-2026.rst:8
msgid ""
"`Evidence S122 "
"<https://www.jingan.gov.cn/govxxgk/JA2/2026-05-18/117b6400-28b1-4035-8fc1-3e28685f8668.html>`_. "
"关于开展2026年第二批静安区服务业发展引导资金项目申报工作的通知."
msgstr "`证据 S122 <https://www.jingan.gov.cn/govxxgk/JA2/2026-05-18/117b6400-28b1-4035-8fc1-3e28685f8668.html>`_. 关于开展2026年第二批静安区服务业发展引导资金项目申报工作的通知."

#: ../../funding/jingan-service-2026.rst:10
msgid "Amount and mechanism"
msgstr "额度与机制"

#: ../../funding/jingan-service-2026.rst:13
msgid ""
"Project-specific support under the district service-industry guidance "
"fund rules, matched to qualifying project investment"
msgstr "依区服务业发展引导资金办法给予支持，按合资格项目总投资及类别核定"

#: ../../funding/jingan-service-2026.rst:15
msgid "No equity"
msgstr "不占股"

#: ../../funding/jingan-service-2026.rst:17
msgid "Eligibility and timing"
msgstr "资格与时间"

#: ../../funding/jingan-service-2026.rst:20
msgid ""
"Lawfully registered, tax-paying legal-person organizations in Jing'an "
"with sound credit, advancing modern services, enterprise AI, data "
"services or digital commerce under the 2026 batch rules and 2026-2028 AI "
"demonstration plan."
msgstr "在静安依法设立、纳税且信用良好的法人组织，符合2026年申报通知及2026至2028年人工智能创新应用示范区方向的现代服务业、企业人工智能、数据服务或数字商业项目。"

#: ../../funding/jingan-service-2026.rst:22
msgid ""
"Second 2026 batch published May 2026; confirm current sub-district "
"recommending window"
msgstr "2026年第二批通知于5月发布，须向所属街镇或功能区确认当前推荐受理窗口"

#: ../../funding/jingan-service-2026.rst:24
msgid "Contact and application"
msgstr "联系与申请"

#: ../../funding/jingan-service-2026.rst:27
msgid ""
"`Official application / policy route "
"<https://www.jingan.gov.cn/govxxgk/JA2/2026-05-18/117b6400-28b1-4035-8fc1-3e28685f8668.html>`_"
msgstr "`官方申请／政策入口 <https://www.jingan.gov.cn/govxxgk/JA2/2026-05-18/117b6400-28b1-4035-8fc1-3e28685f8668.html>`_"

#: ../../funding/jingan-service-2026.rst:29
msgid ""
"The linked authority or operator is the contact route. A direct current "
"program contact is not established in this profile."
msgstr "请通过所链主管部门或运营方联系，本档案未核实现任项目直接联系人。"

#: ../../funding/jingan-service-2026.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../funding/jingan-service-2026.rst:33
msgid ""
"Read the dated call and verify district, entity, activity and "
"spending-period rules."
msgstr "阅读带日期通知，核验属地、主体、业务及支出期间。"

#: ../../funding/jingan-service-2026.rst:35
msgid ""
"Prepare the prescribed pack and complete host or district endorsement if "
"required."
msgstr "准备规定材料，按要求完成单位或区级推荐。"

#: ../../funding/jingan-service-2026.rst:37
msgid ""
"Submit through the official platform before the stated deadline and keep "
"the receipt."
msgstr "在截止前通过官方平台提交并保存回执。"

#: ../../funding/jingan-service-2026.rst:39
msgid ""
"Follow review, award, reporting, acceptance and payment obligations in "
"the notice."
msgstr "遵循通知中的评审、立项、报告、验收及拨付义务。"

#: ../../funding/jingan-service-2026.rst:41
msgid ""
"The published maximum is a ceiling, not an entitlement. Check the "
"applicable notice, eligible cost period, other public support and written "
"payment conditions."
msgstr "公布最高额为上限，不构成当然权益。须核验适用通知、合资格支出期间、其他财政资助及书面拨付条件。"
